OL,3,GNEWSAWaverley paddle steamer marks 80th
OL,4,Aanniversary since launch
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe world's last sea-going paddle
OL,7,Fsteamer has marked 80 years since it
OL,8,Fwas first launched on Glasgow's River
OL,9,FKelvin.
OL,11,FThe Waverley passed through London's
OL,12,FTower Bridge earlier, as part of an
OL,13,Fanniversary voyage on the Thames.
OL,15,FNow based on the River Clyde, the ship
OL,16,Fhas been restored to its original 1940s
OL,17,Fstyle. It makes nostalgic trips around
OL,18,FUK ports and is one of the most
OL,19,Frecognisable historic vessels in the
OL,20,Fworld.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
