OL,3,GNEWSAWaverley paddle steamer marks 80th
OL,4,Aanniversary since launch
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 150,000 passengers have
OL,7,Ftravelled on the steamer every summer
OL,8,Ffor the past three years.
